{
  "$comment": "Seeds only: scripts/generate-themes.mjs derives every other --ui-* token and fails unless each theme x mode passes WCAG AA and every heading weight is a face the font catalog ships. \"site\" is the fixed website theme on <html> (never offered in the editor); \"themes\" are the editor themes, applied only inside ThemeScope elements (editor root, theme-picker cards). radius scales the base radii in _tokens.scss; shadowTint colours the light-mode shadows; headingWeight (default 600), displayWeight (h1/h2, page titles; default headingWeight) and headingScale (default 1) tune the heading face. Optional per mode: accent2 (decorative; default: accent hue + 40) and sunken (hover/table-head plane; default: derived from bg and text). Every editor theme also carries \"billet\": the starting preset picking the theme writes into a billet (docs/billet-document.md) - light/dark BilletPalette (accent, accentSoft, border, background, ink, inkSoft, surface), typography (six FontRef roles + emphasis; each fontId + weight/italic must be a face of the font catalog) and 4..7 particleColors; both palettes must pass the billet contrast rules. The rose preset is the original Mother's Day card (docs/fixtures/muttertag.billet.json) and must stay equal to it.",
